  "body": "## What changed\n\n`crates/app/tests/lathe_post_css.rs` Gate map header named `app::post`. The post suite's module lives in the post crate since the M4.1 split (`crates/post/src/post/`), so the xtask test `no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` failed on main. Corrected the same way #965 corrected the other headers.\n\nHeader before:\n\n    //! Gate map (M4.4): covers app::cutting, app::cutting_turn,\n    //! app::commands (ApplyCuttingData), app::posting (the CSS PARAMs),\n    //! app::post (both lathe dialects), app::project (the additive key),\n    //! tools::turning_data.\n\nHeader after:\n\n    //! Gate map (M4.4): covers app::cutting, app::cutting_turn,\n    //! app::commands (ApplyCuttingData), app::posting (the CSS PARAMs),\n    //! post::post (both lathe dialects), app::project (the additive key),\n    //! tools::turning_data.\n\nOther entries checked against `crates/*/src`: `app::cutting`, `app::cutting_turn`, `app::commands`, `app::posting`, `app::project` exist under `crates/app/src`; `tools::turning_data` exists under `crates/tools/src`. No other header needed a fix.\n\nComment-only change. `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` not touched.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `cargo test -p xtask`: 48 passed, 0 failed (includes `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app`).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --dry-run --base origin/main`: selects `app:lathe_post_css` (whole suite, suite changed outside its test fns), one step.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe suite itself was not run; the change is a comment line.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1184\n",
